{"title":"毛主席在杭州查看卫生工作","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1958,"month":1,"day":31}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"候波"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毛主席来了!杭州小营巷的居民们得知这个消息后，都急忙从家里出来欢迎毛主席，抢着和毛主席握手。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(新华社记者　侯波摄)"}],"comments":[],"origin":"新华社","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}